    Type is Wyrm, that you control, gain this effect.\r\n\u25CF Once per opponent's
    turn (Quick Effect): You can place 1 \"Ryu-Ge\" Continuous Spell you control
    on the bottom of the Deck, then target 1 face-up monster on the field; its ATK
    becomes 0."
